                <div class="ir-intro  ">
            <div class="ir-intro__body">
                    <div class="generic-content">
                        <p>White Pebbles is a Swedish investment company focused on long-term value creation through active investments in unlisted companies. The company's goal is to build a portfolio of unlisted companies and fund structures with underlying companies, and by providing both capital and strategic expertise, develop the portfolio companies and strengthen their growth potential. The company is headquartered in Stockholm.</p>
                    </div>
